WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.581
Question three. Highlight: which item is NOT an information-system component; options include scanner, software, sales records, and a “layout plan”.

00:00:10.581 --> 00:00:18.516
Useful: typical components are hardware, software, data, procedures/people; the question asks for the outsider.

00:00:18.516 --> 00:00:22.377
Useless: festival stall mood — does not help the pick.

00:00:22.377 --> 00:00:27.953
Option A. Barcode scanner — hardware, a real component — cut (not the answer).

00:00:27.953 --> 00:00:31.742
Option B. POS software — software, a component — cut.

00:00:31.742 --> 00:00:35.746
Option C. Day’s sales records — data, a component — cut.

00:00:35.746 --> 00:00:40.893
Option D. Stall layout plan — decoration only, not in processing — keep.

00:00:40.893 --> 00:00:44.825
Only the decorative layout plan is not an IS component.

00:00:44.825 --> 00:00:47.256
Therefore the correct answer is D.
